  "$\\sin u=u-\\frac{u^3}{3!}+\\frac{u^5}{5!}-\\cdots$ s $u={@0}$: koeficient pri $x^{{@1}}$ je ${@2}\\frac{{@3}^{{@4}}}{{@5}!}$": "$\\sin u=u-\\frac{u^3}{3!}+\\frac{u^5}{5!}-\\cdots$ com $u={@0}$: o coeficiente de $x^{{@1}}$ é ${@2}\\frac{{@3}^{{@4}}}{{@5}!}$",
