  "$a_n-{@0}=\\dfrac{{@1}-{@2}({@3})}{n+{@4}}=\\dfrac{{@5}}{n+{@6}}$, teda $|a_n-{@7}|=\\dfrac{{@8}}{n+{@9}}$, čo s rastúcim $n$ klesá. Nerovnosť $\\frac{{@10}}{n+{@11}}\\lt\\frac{1}{{@12}}$ je ekvivalentná s $n+{@13}\\gt {@14}$, teda $n\\gt {@15}$. Najmenšie vyhovujúce $N={@16}$.": "$a_n-{@0}=\\dfrac{{@1}-{@2}({@3})}{n+{@4}}=\\dfrac{{@5}}{n+{@6}}$, logo $|a_n-{@7}|=\\dfrac{{@8}}{n+{@9}}$, que decresce à medida que $n$ cresce. A desigualdade $\\frac{{@10}}{n+{@11}}\\lt\\frac{1}{{@12}}$ é equivalente a $n+{@13}\\gt {@14}$, ou seja, $n\\gt {@15}$. O menor $N$ que serve é $N={@16}$.",
